# agentsmemory — .site checkout

This folder is the Prompt Anatomy **discovery** site (`promptanatomy.site`, repo `DITreneris/site`). Memory is the local palace at `http://127.0.0.1:8080/mcp` (user-level MCP). Cursor has no Stop hook — this rule is the write half.

Default wing: `promptanatomy` (ecosystem canon already lives there). **Do not mint a `site` wing.** MCP `default_wing` is empty — every `am_*` call must pass `wing: promptanatomy`. `wing: "*"` only for a deliberate cross-project question.

## First actions of every session

1. `am_status` — `mode` must be `local`, workspace slug `local`. A different workspace is a stop — write nothing.
2. `am_skillset` and follow it.
3. `am_load_skill("promptanatomy")`.
4. `am_bootstrap` with `wing: promptanatomy`.

## Recall

Ecosystem roles, CTA to `.app`, six-block vs Quick mode, two-channel pricing (39/99 vs 399) → `am_search` wing `promptanatomy`. Checkout and access live on `.app`, not here.

## Persist

`am_diary_write` agent_name `cursor-memory`, wing `promptanatomy` only when this session settled a **new** ecosystem fact. Do not re-file hub deploy/access canon.

## Never mine into the palace

This spoke's source, `primal_concept.txt`, course JSON, sibling spoke repos. Do not dump the site tree into drawers. Code stays here; palace stays memory.

MVP here: marketing/demo only. No auth, CMS, backend, or Stripe unless explicitly requested.
